WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
This is a simple line of text.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>This text is bold.</b>

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<i>This text is italic.</i>

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<font color="#ff0000">This text is red.</font>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<b>Inline bold</b> formatting.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<i>Inline italic</i> formatting.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<font color="#FF0000">Red</font> and <font color="#00FF00">green</font> text.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Text with<br/>line break.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<font size="27">Larger text</font> here.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<font color="#FF0000" size="18">Big red</font> and <font color="#0000FF" size="13">small blue</font> text.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
<font color="#ff0000"><b>Bold red text.</b></font>

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<font color="#ff0000" size="28">Large red text.</font>

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
<font color="#ff0000"><i>Italic red text.</i></font>

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
<font color="#ff0000" size="28"><b>Bold large red text.</b></font>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<font size="28"><i>Italic large text.</i></font>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<font size="28"><b>Bold large text.</b></font>

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Final test line.
